# B-04: an Allrun that fails in reconstructPar because the end time comes before the first write. The app must show the
# failing log and say why, with the numbers and where to change them.
open $SB/ws/multiRegionHeater
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click dict:system/controlDict:endTime
enter 0.02
click run-go
# Run asks first now: nothing would be written (H-08); go on, to see how the failure is explained
wait-until modal precheck timeout 10
assert text Nothing would be written
click m-pc-go
wait-until job running timeout 10
wait-until job idle timeout 300
wait 20
assert job failed
wait-until text No results were written timeout 10
screenshot $OUT/no_write.png
assert text The error is in log.reconstructPar
assert text write is at t = 0.001 + 10 = 10.001
click err-open
wait-until page Files
